{"created": "2026-06-29T04:14:30.445315+00:00", "modified": "2026-06-29T04:14:30.609739+00:00", "id": 21018700, "conceptrecid": "21018699", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21018699", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "metadata": {"title": "PhishRewrite: a benchmark for LLM-driven evasion of phishing detectors", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "publication_date": "2026-06-29", "description": "<p>PhishRewrite is a benchmark and code artifact for measuring how content-based phishing/spam detectors degrade when phishing text is rewritten by a large language model to read as benign while preserving the malicious ask.</p>\n<p>Contents: (1) emails.csv &mdash; 28,201 labelled emails (phishing from the Nazario corpus; ham from SpamAssassin and Enron) under a unified schema; (2) rewrites.csv &mdash; 4,000 LLM rewrites of held-out phishing emails at four severities (light paraphrase &rarr; full rewrite preserving only the call-to-action), generated with Claude Haiku 4.5 and Google Gemini 2.5 Flash; (3) the verbatim severity prompts, provenance, licences, and a refang script.</p>\n<p>All URLs are defanged (http&rarr;hxxp, https&rarr;hxxps,&nbsp;<a class=\"text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline underline-offset-[1px] outline-none hide-focus-ring ring-focus rounded-r2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">www.&rarr;www[</a>.]), scheme-only and losslessly &mdash; reverse with the included refang.py to recompute URL features. The headline result is the detector recall/PR-AUC degradation curve versus rewrite severity, with a URL-masked ablation and a same-era external-validity replication on CEAS-2008.</p>\n<p>Intended use: defensive security research and detector hardening only. Prohibited: sending email, real phishing or social-engineering, or deployment against people or live systems. Derived entirely from public named research corpora; no PII collection, no live scraping, no email sending. See ETHICS.md and LIMITATIONS.md in the archive.</p>\n<p>Code:&nbsp;<a class=\"text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline underline-offset-[1px] outline-none hide-focus-ring ring-focus rounded-r2\" href=\"https://github.com/gaurangkatyal/phishrewrite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/gaurangkatyal/phishrewrite</a> (MIT). Data: CC-BY-4.0; upstream corpus terms documented in PROVENANCE.md.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Katyal, Gaurang", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0001-0850-1673"}], "keywords": ["phishing detection", "adversarial machine learning", "large language models", "LLM evasion", "spam filtering", "robustness", "NLP security", "benchmark dataset"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/gaurangkatyal/phishrewrite", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.8339691", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/gaurangkatyal/phishrewrite", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21018699"}}]}}, "title": "PhishRewrite: a benchmark for LLM-driven evasion of phishing detectors", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21018700", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21018700?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21018700", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018699", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21018699", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21018699", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21018699", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21018700/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21018700/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21018700/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/requests"}, "updated": "2026-06-29T04:14:30.609739+00:00", "recid": "21018700", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "1638a3d7-7896-4726-9c30-22d9f612067e", "key": "phishrewrite-benchmark-v1.0.zip", "size": 21371735, "checksum": "md5:6868f01f5c416a93b5c3ffccc6a947c8", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21018700/files/phishrewrite-benchmark-v1.0.zip/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1659797"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 20, "unique_downloads": 17, "views": 44, "unique_views": 42, "version_downloads": 20, "version_unique